MODULE: NoMigrationDuringResizeBeginIgnoresReshard
TARGET: NoMigrationDuringResize
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: resize captures a map while an admitted reshard is changing it
PERTURBS: ResizeBegin

--- FIND
    /\ operation = "none" /\ migration \in {"idle", "done"}
--- REPLACE
    /\ operation = "none"
--- END
